      "modified": "2026-01-04 18:48:04",
      "modified_utc": "2026-01-05 00:48:04",
      "url": "https://americangimuseum.org/events/history-in-motion-2026/",
      "rest_url": "https://americangimuseum.org/wp-json/tribe/events/v1/events/17580",
      "title": "History in Motion 2026",
      "description": "<p><b><strong>Coming November 7 &amp; 8, 2026<br />\n</strong></b></p>\n<p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"483\"><strong data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"119\">Tanks, Tanks, Tanks!</strong><br data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"122\" />Feel the ground shake and engines roar at the Museum of the American G.I.\u2019s <em data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"217\">History in Motion</em>! Watch historic tanks, military vehicles, and artillery spring to life in a thrilling, action-filled weekend that brings the past into the present. You\u2019ll experience one of the South\u2019s premier collections of fully restored WWII and Vietnam-era vehicles\u2014<em data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"482\">in motion</em>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"796\">This family-friendly event is packed with exciting activities for all ages! Tanks and vehicles will run throughout the day, with special demonstrations featuring historic weapons, artillery, and rare vehicles. Between shows, explore the displays up close\u2014or climb aboard for a ride in a WWII tank or Half-Track!</p>\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"1034\">We begin each day with a\u00a0<strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1463\">special presentation of the National Anthem at 10:00 AM</strong>, setting the stage for the day&#8217;s events.\u00a0 The event will showcase special weapons demonstrations, and <strong>TWO BIG Vehicle Demonstrations.\u00a0 </strong>Make sure you do not\u00a0leave early or you will miss the finale: a powerful <strong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1903\" data-is-only-node=\"\">artillery demonstration</strong>\u00a0that ends the day with a BOOM!</p>\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1118\"><strong data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1061\">Gates open at 9:00 AM</strong><br data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1064\" /><strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1118\">Event hours: Saturday &amp; Sunday, 10:00 AM \u2013 3:00 PM</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1306\"><strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1136\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">FREE Parking</span></span></strong> is available at <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Santa&#8217;s Wonderland&#8217;s Blitzen Lot</span></span>. From there, you enter the museum grounds through the admission tent.</p>\n<h3>TICKET INFORMATION</h3>\n<p><strong>One Day Tickets (Cash price)\u00a0 \u00a0$25 Adults, $10 Kids (5-17), Under 5 free</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Speed through the line by purchasing admission tickets online!\u00a0 Available starting September 9, 2026, at 10 AM</strong></p>\n<h4>Click the button below for a list of activities!</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://americangimuseum.org/discover/living-history/history-in-motion/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-17098 size-full\" src=\"https://americangimuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Learn-More-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>History in Motion is a \u201cSpecial Event Day\u2019 and regular admission prices are not valid.</p>\n<p><em><strong>This is an outdoor event, and the museum building will not be open during History in Motion.</strong></em></p>\n<p><strong>\u00a0</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
