      "url": "https://americangimuseum.org/events/living-history-school-day-2027/",
      "rest_url": "https://americangimuseum.org/wp-json/tribe/events/v1/events/17736",
      "title": "Living History School Day 2027",
      "description": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">We invite you to join us on April 2, 2027 for the Museum of the American G.I.\u2019s Living History School Day\u2014where history comes alive.</p>\n<p>Through a series of living history camps, students will explore U.S. military history from the Civil War to the present day. Each station offers a unique perspective\u2014whether through equipment displays, demonstrations, or first-person interpretation\u2014designed to engage curiosity and encourage questions.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2138\">Students move through the program on a <strong data-start=\"2014\" data-end=\"2041\">timed rotation schedule</strong>, ensuring each group has the opportunity to participate in multiple stations throughout the day.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2203\">Free parking is provided at <strong data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2202\">Santa\u2019s Wonderland Blitzen Lot</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2361\"><strong data-start=\"2205\" data-end=\"2256\">Registration opens January 27, 2027, at 10:00 AM</strong><br data-start=\"2256\" data-end=\"2259\" />$10 Students | $7 Parents and Extended Family<br data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2307\" />Private/Public Schools: 1 teacher at no charge for every 10 students</p>\n<p data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2453\">Space is limited to 300 students. Registration closes March 19 or when capacity is reached.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2553\">This is an <strong data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2491\">outdoor special event</strong>, and the museum building will not be open during the program.</p>\n<h4>Click the button below for more information!</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://americangimuseum.org/discover/living-history/living-history-school-day/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-17098\" src=\"https://americangimuseum.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Learn-More-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"40\" /></a></p>",
